The '''Boz Pity system''' was a [[star system]] located in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]<ref name="Appendix" /> that was part of the [[Kashyyyk Region]]<ref name="Route" /> and [[the Slice]].<ref name="The Slice" /> The [[Ilosian Spur]] [[hyperspace route]] connected it to the [[Bimmisaari system]] and the [[Alee system]].<ref name="Route" /> The system had at least one [[orbit]], [[Boz Pity]].<ref name="RotS" /> Some [[time]] prior to the [[Battle of Yavin]], [[Han Solo]] scammed the [[Unidentified sultan's daughter|daughter]] of a [[Unidentified sultan|sultan]] in the system.<ref name="SW8" />

